  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo Continuo al Programa de Transformacin del Sector Pblico</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continued Support to the Public Sector Transformation Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo de este programa es aumentar la eficiencia en la gestin de los recursos humanos, financieros y organizativos del sector pblico. Este objetivo general se lograr mediante los siguientes objetivos especficos: (i) mejorar la gestin de las funciones bsicas de apoyo gubernamental; (ii) optimizar la estructura y los mecanismos de coordinacin del gobierno; y (iii) fortalecer la gestin del capital humano del sector pblico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective of this programme is to increase the efficiency of the management of public sector human, financial and organizational resources. This objective will be accomplished through the following specific development objectives: (i) enhancing the management of core government support functions; (ii) optimizing the structure and the coordination mechanisms of government; and (iii) strengthening public sector human capital management.</narrative>
  </description>
